                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">RECAP  -  Top profile
Goal: a second, smaller outline for the roof.
Idea: the same Polygon you built in Level A, with its own
radius and fillet. It sits on the ground for now -
the next steps lift it up and twist it.</item>
