                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 2  -  Point it upward
Goal: a vector straight up, as long as the tower is tall.
Idea: a vector = a direction x a length.
Unit Z gives the direction; its Factor sets the length.
Watch for: Unit X / Unit Y point sideways.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
