                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 6  -  Close the mass
Goal: a closed solid (Brep) - the tower mass.
Idea: Loft leaves the top and bottom open;
Cap Holes adds flat lids to planar openings.
Watch for: only flat (planar) openings can be capped.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
