                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 7  -  Check your result
Goal: a number that proves the mass is right.
Idea: read outputs as data, not just as a picture.
Area gives the surface area (sf) and the centroid.
Try it: set Total twist to 0 - the area drops,
because twisting stretches the skin.</item>
