            <chunk name="Object" index="165">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
                    <item name="Bold" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Ca" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>45</X>
                      <Y>-185</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>996.9316</X>
                      <Y>-185</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>996.9316</X>
                      <Y>-132.33594</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cd" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>45</X>
                      <Y>-132.33594</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">15418afc-31f7-49ad-9220-5257119a23ad</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">12</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LEVEL B - Build the twisting mass  |  B01 (Simple method)  |  EDUCATIONAL PROTOTYPE - not in the game repo.  Units: feet.
One concept per stage. Every stage opens with a note:  Goal (what it makes)  -  Idea (the concept)  -  Watch for / Wire check (common mistakes, which input a wire goes into).
GIVEN = from Level A, not quizzed.  RECAP = a node you already know, reused here, not quizzed.  STEP n = quizzed: red B01_Q## is the question node.
